# R3 documenso/documenso apps/remix, commit 8a41a3bf618d9e46e2e1c0f437aa0488d91b85de
# Hand-derived from the files under app/routes/** with remix-flat-routes (app/routes.ts: flatRoutes('routes', ..., ignoredRouteFiles ['**/.*']), hybrid '+' folders).
# Rule: a '+' folder is only an organising prefix (_authenticated+/o.$orgUrl.settings.billing.tsx = _authenticated.o.$orgUrl.settings.billing); '.' separates segments;
# a leading '_' segment is pathless (_authenticated, _unauthenticated, _internal, _recipient, _share, _redirects, _v0); _index is the index route; _layout is the folder layout (the folder path itself);
# $param -> :param; a trailing '_' on a segment only breaks nesting (authoring_.completed -> authoring/completed); [x] escapes a literal segment ([__htmltopdf] -> /__htmltopdf).
# Only modules with a default export are screens; the 16 modules without one are excluded (api+/* resource routes, _redirects+/ingest.$, _share+/share.$slug.opengraph,
# _unauthenticated+/organisation.decline.$token, the root _index.tsx and _authenticated+/t.$teamUrl+/_index.tsx are loader-only). The .css file and dot files are ignored.
# Pathless layouts (_layout of _authenticated, _unauthenticated, ...) add no URL. Layouts that own a path and have no index child at the same URL (settings, o/:orgUrl/settings, t/:teamUrl/settings, embed/v1|v2/authoring) count as that URL.
# /t/:teamUrl is not a URL — t.$teamUrl+/_index.tsx (loader-only, throw redirect(formatDocumentsPath(...))) owns that URL, so the layout never renders there (same as the root _index).
